# Raw Intel Unified Telemetry / SoCWatch captures are large binaries (100s of MB)
# and per-run transient state — kept LOCAL, never committed. The community-grade
# SUMMARY of a run lives in BlarAI docs/performance/*.json + PERFORMANCE_LOG.md;
# the small reusable artifacts (tier0-*.csv samples, tier0-sampler.ps1) ARE committed.
*.bin
ut-*.json
ut-current.*
